    rdau:P61101 "<a href='https://williewestofficial.com/'>Toimijan verkkosivut</a>, katsottu 22.1.2026 (Willie West is one of the original Soul and Blues men. He was born Millard Leon West on December 8, 1941 in Raceland, Louisiana ... He moved to New Orleans in 1960 ... he has fronted many notable New Orleans bands including The Meters, Electric Soul Train, Oliver and the Rockets, the Gladiators with David Batiste and Uptown Rulers ... In 2014 \"Lost Soul\" came out on CD and vinyl from Jukka Sarapaa and his Timmion Records label out of Helsinki, Finland. The High Society Brothers Band backed this project. ...)"@fi ;
